{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/271819-potential-roles-for-analysts","id":271819,"title":"Potential Roles for Analysts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-10-03T16:24:01-07:00","id":271819,"title":"Potential Roles for Analysts","content":"I'm having a hard time coming up with potential tasks for Analysts. Might anyone have any suggestions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T16:39:25-07:00","id":271859,"title":"","content":"There's one in the opening fiction of Seattle. Anyways we have a player who was an observer he was supposed to watch the people who interacted with angels. I also have a background observer monitoring ghosts in a 3 mile radious around a cemetery but not within the cemetary itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T17:05:55-07:00","id":271873,"title":"","content":"They seem to be the Angels that gather info and report it back to the God-Machine as their Mission. They're different to a Messenger as they are more passive, merely making an observation or at least they're told to go and observe something. I see most Falling as they got distracted somehow, that something bigger in their eyes at least pull them away and now they're a Demon. Messengers are more the type to go and interact with something in giving someone information then telling the God-Machine after how the person reacted and seeing if they need to do more... Analysts are probably in the background feeding the God-Machine other info based on that interaction which allows the God-Machine to react accordingly and give more intel to the Messenger.<br /> <br /> Also Analysts have Missions likely paired up with other Angels, watching to see how they do their Missions and reporting how effectively it was done, which the God-Machine can take in and compare, so to better work future Missions by making sure the right kind of Angels are off doing what they have been made for. In a way, it's a good way to link PCs together if one is an Analyst as the one Falling likely triggered a domino effect to make the other Fall and some of the best cells are made from Demons who used to a circle of Angels all on the same Mission and when one Fell it takes the others down with them through a butterfly effect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T09:33:11-07:00","id":272301,"title":"","content":"Hmmm. Maybe what I'm needing is a better understanding of what a little-a analyst actually does. Does anyone know what a mundane analyst job entails?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T10:05:51-07:00","id":272320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>shkspr1048</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/271819-potential-roles-for-analysts?p=272301#post272301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm. Maybe what I'm needing is a better understanding of what a little-a analyst actually does. Does anyone know what a mundane analyst job entails?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've got a bit of temp work coming up that was explained to me as &quot;literally just shadow this person and time how long it takes them to put data into spreadsheets.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T10:15:04-07:00","id":272324,"title":"","content":"The big thing about Analysts is that they don't just watch-they <i>process</i>. It's not enough to see, Analysts work to understand what's going on, to draw connections, deign what's useful and filter out useless information. They have to piece together context.<br /> <br /> As angels they aren't the most active, but they are probably the most vital, because they're where the plans the God-Machine makes begins.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T18:55:43-07:00","id":272631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/271819-potential-roles-for-analysts?p=272324#post272324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The big thing about Analysts is that they don't just watch-they <i>process</i>. It's not enough to see, Analysts work to understand what's going on, to draw connections, deign what's useful and filter out useless information. They have to piece together context.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. If you take the name at face value, the Analysts don't collect information, they parse it. They are the G-M's front end interface, taking data collected from Occult Matrices, Infrastructures, Angels, and Facilities, and compiling it into a form that the G-M can understand. (I just got the chills writing that.)<br /> <br /> The one role I can think of for an Analyst would be debriefing captured demons, trying to process <i>why</i> a tool suddenly started seeing the world in human terms and rebelled. I'm pretty sure the interrogator on page 181 of DtD is an Analyst.<br /> <br /> And then malfunctioning tool will be disassembled, and any still usable parts will be used to make new, improved, more reliable tools.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}